        "original_id": "38db07f7-7828-568d-8a81-d416771b18b3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tina Turner, Ike Turner, Angela Bassett, Laurence Fishburne, Brian Gibson\n- Works: What's Love Got to Do with It, Ike & Tina Turner Revue\n- Topics: Biographical films, rock and roll\n\nFacts:\n- Ike Turner was an early pioneer of 1950s rock and roll.\n- In the 1960s and 1970s, Ike Turner was most popularly known for performing with his then-wife Tina Turner in the Ike & Tina Turner Revue.\n- What's Love Got to Do with It is a 1993 American biographical film directed by Brian Gibson and loosely based on the life of Tina Turner.\n- In What's Love Got to Do with It, Angela Bassett stars as Tina Turner and Laurence Fishburne stars as Ike Turner.",
